==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''snúa''' (+{{dat}}/+{{acc}}) ([[snýr]]; [[snéri]]/[[sneri]], [[snéru]]/[[sneru]], [[snúið]])

# to [[turn]]

====Usage notes====
* One of the four [[w:is:Ri-sagnir|ri-verbs]] in Icelandic; [[núa]], [[gróa]] and [[róa]].
* Even though that the forms which include an ''[[e]]'' are pronounced as having an ''[[é]]'', the ''[[e]]''-spelling is thought to be correct by the [[w:is:Menntamálaráðuneyti Íslands|Icelandic ministry of education]]. E.g. the [[first person]] [[singular]] [[past tense]] [[indicative]] of the word ''[[snúa]]'' ("to turn") which is ''[[sneri]]'' ("I turned") is preferred over the spellings ''[[snéri]]''- even though both are used.

